      "en": "Diagram of Pappaus & Verestys, minimizing stress in C&R, classic Lohikeitto salmon soup, butter-fried perch, and traditional wood-smoking.",
      "zh": "击晕处死与割鳃放血两步法图示、路亚放流黄金守则、正宗芬兰三文鱼莳萝浓汤（Lohikeitto）与黄油香煎脆皮五道黑视频教学。",
      "fi": "Pappaus ja verestys kaaviona, vastuullinen vapauttaminen, lohikeitto ja kalaruoat."
